{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-tourn-106"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816100-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","missionId":"event-tourn-106","mission":"특별 할인","scene":"특별 할인","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 황폐한 폐허를 걷고 있다. 입자인멸충이 우주 에너지 전쟁 때 이곳을 깡그리 갉아먹어서 흙과 바위도 남지 않은 창백한 지상에 자판기 한 대가 덩그러니 놓여있다","talkId":403816100,"textHash":"4902343756739868179","source":"tournHandBookEvent:106/talk-403816100","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c65ff4a038d888f4","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816101-line"],"bwikiPage":"特别优惠","bwikiRevision":96716,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13813","bwikiMission":"특별 할인"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816101-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","missionId":"event-tourn-106","mission":"특별 할인","scene":"특별 할인","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"자판기는 자랑스럽게 자신의 직무를 수행하고 있었지만, 당신이 오는 바람에 출근할 필요 없던 좋은 시절은 다 갔다","talkId":403816101,"textHash":"8271007220686340203","source":"tournHandBookEvent:106/talk-403816101","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c65ff4a038d888f4","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816102-line"],"bwikiPage":"特别优惠","bwikiRevision":96716,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13813","bwikiMission":"특별 할인"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816102-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","missionId":"event-tourn-106","mission":"특별 할인","scene":"특별 할인","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「로직: 본 기계는 아직 전시 관리 모드입니다. 당신이 전쟁보다 더 높은 투자 가치와 승리 확률을 보유하고 있다는 것을 증명하십시오」","talkId":403816102,"textHash":"14111031426759723914","source":"tournHandBookEvent:106/talk-403816102","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c65ff4a038d888f4","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816103-line"],"bwikiPage":"特别优惠","bwikiRevision":96716,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13813","bwikiMission":"특별 할인"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816103-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","missionId":"event-tourn-106","mission":"특별 할인","scene":"특별 할인","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「당신의 투자 가치에 따라 본 기계가 당신에게 제공할 서비스 표준을 평가합니다」","talkId":403816103,"textHash":"13420528811312360984","source":"tournHandBookEvent:106/talk-403816103","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c65ff4a038d888f4","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816104-line"],"bwikiPage":"特别优惠","bwikiRevision":96716,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13813","bwikiMission":"특별 할인"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816104-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","missionId":"event-tourn-106","mission":"특별 할인","scene":"특별 할인","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「그렇지 않을 경우, 본 기계는 당신을 지원하는 것이 컴퍼니의 이익을 최대화할 수 없다고 판단, 당신의 소비 요구를 거절할 수 있습니다——삐빅, 당신의 전투력 측정을 곧 시작합니다」","talkId":403816104,"textHash":"15817624109369210931","source":"tournHandBookEvent:106/talk-403816104","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"c65ff4a038d888f4","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"特别优惠","bwikiRevision":96716,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13813","bwikiMission":"특별 할인"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-8177723585964728621-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","missionId":"event-tourn-106","mission":"특별 할인","scene":"특별 할인","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"당신의 실력을 보여준다","talkId":null,"textHash":"8177723585964728621","source":"tournHandBookEvent:106/text-8177723585964728621","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"613b1ad982af955b","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-7169578995339613894-effect"],"bwikiPage":"特别优惠","bwikiRevision":96716,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13813","bwikiMission":"특별 할인"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-7169578995339613894-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","missionId":"event-tourn-106","mission":"특별 할인","scene":"특별 할인","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"승리한 자만이 투자할 가치가 있다","talkId":null,"textHash":"7169578995339613894","source":"tournHandBookEvent:106/text-7169578995339613894","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"613b1ad982af955b","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"特别优惠","bwikiRevision":96716,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13813","bwikiMission":"특별 할인","bwikiReplyToIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-8177723585964728621-choice"]},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-talk-403816107-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","missionId":"event-tourn-106","mission":"특별 할인","scene":"특별 할인","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「삐빅, 측정 시작. 측정 범위를 벗어나지 마십시오」","talkId":403816107,"textHash":"12620404731774972134","source":"tournHandBookEvent:106/talk-403816107","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"0113dc867670711f","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"特别优惠","bwikiRevision":96716,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13813","bwikiMission":"특별 할인"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-1391645279459064646-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-106","missionId":"event-tourn-106","mission":"특별 할인","scene":"특별 할인","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"다시 한번 잘 생각해 보는 게 좋을 텐데","talkId":null,"textHash":"1391645279459064646","source":"tournHandBookEvent:106/text-1391645279459064646","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ad8237ae188d2309","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-106-text-4235411751154757136-effect"],"bwikiPage":"特别优惠","bwikiRevision":96716,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-13813","bwikiMission":"특별 할인